# Conclusions recorded 2026-10-02:
#  - MariaDB 11.8 has NO wsrep_on in SHOW GLOBAL STATUS (VARIABLES only);
#    wsrep_incoming_addresses is a STATUS var (AUTO,AUTO,AUTO here).
#  - wsrep_desync_count is a GAUGE (0 on all Synced nodes before AND after the
#    SST), not a cumulative counter; an SST donor shows desync=OFF + count=1.
#  - Donor state spelling from reality: "Donor/Desynced" (slash).
#  - Joiner mid-SST/IST = connection refused, not 1047 — on this setup.
